adjudication.rationale:
In packages/core/EventManager.ts the diff changes the Meet fallback check to:
```ts
const [mainHostDestinationCalendar] = evt.destinationCalendar ?? [];
if (evt.location === MeetLocationType && mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration !== "google_calendar")
```
If `evt.destinationCalendar` is `null`, `undefined`, or `[]`, destructuring yields `mainHostDestinationCalendar === undefined`, and accessing `.integration` will throw a TypeError. The diff also introduces multiple call sites that explicitly set `destinationCalendar` to an empty array when no calendar is selected (e.g. confirm.handler.ts, Stripe/PayPal webhooks, bookingReminder.ts), making this crash reachable from those flows.
